{"data":{"id":"Tj6B2_qeS84","slug":"jeedo","title":"Jeedo","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"Ufrz-pjUd-s","slug":"hood-tech","title":"Hood Tech"},{"id":"XncIo0cFYGY","slug":"jeedo-suave","title":"Jeedo Suave"}]},"markers":[{"id":"fGPoJ1XI60g","position":54,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeedo - Hood Tech","track":{"id":"Ufrz-pjUd-s","path":"/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech/","slug":"hood-tech","title":"Hood Tech","artist":{"slug":"jeedo","title":"Jeedo"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"rv7pGUDVcbk","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeedo - Hood Tech","track":{"id":"Ufrz-pjUd-s","path":"/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech/","slug":"hood-tech","title":"Hood Tech","artist":{"slug":"jeedo","title":"Jeedo"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Rhettmatic's Set","position":1}},{"id":"XKb4Wh1-34U","position":80,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeedo - Hood Tech","track":{"id":"Ufrz-pjUd-s","path":"/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech/","slug":"hood-tech","title":"Hood Tech","artist":{"slug":"jeedo","title":"Jeedo"},"artwork":"images/artists/jeedo/tracks/hood-tech.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"9WG9-KCtqnI","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jeedo - Jeedo Suave","track":{"id":"XncIo0cFYGY","path":"/artists/jeedo/tracks/jeedo-suave/","slug":"jeedo-suave","titl